# MLflow file store. paths.mlflow_dir defaults to <repo>/mlruns, so the store lands
# inside the working tree; these are run artefacts, not source. Set TORCA_MLFLOW_DIR
# to move it out of the repo entirely.
mlruns/
# Stores rsynced back from the cluster. The bare `mlruns/` rule above only matches
# directories actually NAMED mlruns, so it covered mlruns_nibi/mlruns/ but not the
# layout an rsync with a different trailing slash produces, where the experiment ids
# land directly under mlruns_nibi/. 838 metric files were committed that way once.
